# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
#  Social Manager - 用户 Nginx 配置模板
#  manage-users.sh 会用 sed 替换以下占位符:
#    __USERNAME__  → 用户名 (如 user01)
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

server {
    listen 443 ssl;
    http2 on;
    server_name __USERNAME__.sm.mayrichbe.cam;

    # SSL 证书（通配符证书，所有子域名共用）
    ssl_certificate     /etc/letsencrypt/live/sm.mayrichbe.cam/fullchain.pem;
    ssl_certificate_key /etc/letsencrypt/live/sm.mayrichbe.cam/privkey.pem;

    # SSL 安全设置
    ssl_protocols TLSv1.2 TLSv1.3;
    ssl_ciphers HIGH:!aNULL:!MD5;
    ssl_prefer_server_ciphers on;

    # 上传大小限制
    client_max_body_size 500m;

    # 所有请求代理到该用户的容器
    location / {
        proxy_pass http://sm-__USERNAME__:8000;
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;
        proxy_read_timeout 300s;
        proxy_send_timeout 300s;

        # WebSocket 支持（如果将来需要）
        proxy_http_version 1.1;
        proxy_set_header Upgrade $http_upgrade;
        proxy_set_header Connection "upgrade";
    }

    # 文件上传专用（更长超时）
    location /api/v1/materials/upload {
        proxy_pass http://sm-__USERNAME__:8000;
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;
        proxy_read_timeout 600s;
        client_max_body_size 500m;
    }

    # 健康检查
    location /health {
        proxy_pass http://sm-__USERNAME__:8000/health;
        access_log off;
    }

    # 静态资源缓存
    location ~* \.(js|css|png|jpg|jpeg|gif|ico|svg|woff2)$ {
        proxy_pass http://sm-__USERNAME__:8000;
        expires 30d;
        add_header Cache-Control "public, no-transform";
    }
}
